    "heading": "Choose a Character Sheet",
    "lineStart": 1720,
    "lineEnd": 1722
  },
  "section": "2.2",
  "rulesText": "You'll record the main details of your character on a character sheet. Throughout this chapter, we use the term \"character sheet\" to mean whatever you use to track your character's details, whether it's a printed character sheet, a digital character sheet, or plain paper. Choose whichever style of sheet works for you, and then embark on creating a character!"
}
